WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.967
1 · Ready: Racket up at chest height, free hand on the throat

2
00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.500
2 · Preparation: Turn sideways early, lift the racket

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.867
3 · Backswing: Racket above the head, elbow about 90°, free arm tracks the ball

4
00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:04.033
4 · Forward swing: Descending path, out and across, not a smash

5
00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.033
5 · Contact: Meet the ball in front, arm extending, wrist firm

6
00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:05.900
6 · Follow through: Keep travelling across to a wrapped finish

7
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.433
7 · Recovery: Use the momentum, step back in to the net

8
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:09.200
Real speed replay

